OL,3,GNEWSAYoghurt factory saved from closure
OL,4,Ato get #1m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south of Scotland yoghurt factory
OL,7,Fwhich was saved from closure four years
OL,8,Fago is to undergo a #1m upgrade.
OL,10,FIt will allow the Rowan Glen site near
OL,11,FPalnure in Galloway to expand the range
OL,12,Fof items it produces.
OL,14,FA buyout - backed by South of Scotland
OL,15,FEnteprise (SOSE) - helped to save the
OL,16,Fplant after previous owners Dale Farm
OL,17,Fdecided it was no longer needed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
